751 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 195 0 R/E(Serving his second term as Secretary-General, Annan was awarded the Nobel Peace Prize in October 2001 alongside the United Nations itself.)/Pg 29 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

752 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 195 0 R/E(His position required balancing genuine solidarity with the United States against the institutional obligation to ensure that any response remained within the framework of international law and the UN Charter. This role carries moral authority but no enforcement power \204 influence must be exercised through persuasion and legitimacy rather than compulsion.)/Pg 29 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

753 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 195 0 R/T(Permanent Members of the Security )/E(Permanent Members of the Security )/Pg 29 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

