867 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 199 0 R/E(Public Directive: Immediate Closure of United States Airspace and Activation of Continuity of Government Protocols)/Pg 33 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

868 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 199 0 R/E(Committee: [Name of Committee])/Pg 33 0 R/K[11]>>
