973 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 202 0 R/E(Communiqu\351s are formal messages addressed to a specific entity rather than to the public at large. They are used for ultimatums, formal demands, declarations, or requests for mediation. They are less frequent than the other document types, but at the right moment they can alter the course of the simulation decisively. Example:)/Pg 36 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

974 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 202 0 R/T(COMMUNIQU\311)/E(COMMUNIQU\311)/Pg 36 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

975 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 202 0 R/E(From: The Government of the United States of America)/Pg 36 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

976 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 202 0 R/E(To: The Leadership of the Islamic Emirate of Afghanistan)/Pg 36 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

977 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 202 0 R/E(Date: 20 September 2001)/Pg 36 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

978 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 202 0 R/E(The Government of the United States holds that the organisation responsible for the attacks of 11 September operates from Afghan territory, with the knowledge and protection of the authorities in Kabul. This communiqu\351 sets out what is required.)/Pg 36 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

979 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 202 0 R/E(Deliver to United States authorities the leadership of al-Qaeda sheltering in your territory. Close every training camp associated with the organisation. Provide access for verification that these camps have in fact been closed. Release any foreign nationals unlawfully detained.)/Pg 36 0 R/K[15]>>
endobj

980 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 202 0 R/E(These are not terms for negotiation. They are not subject to partial compliance or to delay. If they are met, the United States is prepared to discuss the future relationship between our governments. If they are not met, the United States will act to achieve these objectives by other means, and will hold your government responsible for the consequences of that choice.)/Pg 36 0 R/K[16]>>
endobj

981 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 202 0 R/E(The decision rests with you. The time available to make it is limited.)/Pg 36 0 R/K[17]>>
endobj

982 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 202 0 R/E(The Government of the United States of America)/Pg 36 0 R/K[18]>>
endobj

983 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 202 0 R/T(Communiqu\351s)/E(Communiqu\351s)/Pg 36 0 R/K[19]>>
