1005 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 203 0 R/E(Because crisis committees are small, delegates commonly speak more than once within a single moderated caucus. This is where the substantive arguments happen \204 over the standard of proof for attribution, the legal character of the response, the scope of emergency powers, and the terms of regional cooperation.)/Pg 37 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

