1066 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 205 0 R/E(Delegates are expected to research beyond this guide. The following sources are official government publications, primary documents from international organisations, and archived institutional records. Preference should always be given to primary sources and official records over secondary commentary.)/Pg 39 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

1067 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 205 0 R/E(A note on research: the September 11 attacks attract a very large volume of unreliable and deliberately misleading material online. Delegates should confine their research to government archives, official documents of international organisations, and established news organisations with editorial accountability. Material that cannot be traced to an identifiable and credible institution should not be relied upon in committee.)/Pg 39 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

