<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 206 0 R/E(The complete archived records of the Commission, held by the National Archives and Records Administration. Includes staff monographs, staff statements, hearing transcripts and video, witness lists, and commissioner biographies. Useful for delegates researching specific characters or specific institutional failures in detail.)/Pg 40 0 R/K[10]>>
