<</Title(Given the assessment attributing today's attacks to al-Qaeda, and given that the organisation's senior leadership is believed to be located in or moving through the Afghanistan\205Pakistan border region, I request authorisation to activate existing agency assets and deploy a paramilitary team to establish real-time collection on leadership movement. This must occur before any public statement of American intent alerts the target.)/Dest[34 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1763 0 R/Prev 1788 0 R/Next 1800 0 R>>
